        "verse": 9
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "If anyone has an ear, let him hear.",
      "ko": "누구든지 귀가 있거든 들을찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "adcce8705df7f5afc148244ef93ab78fd4111e08438afa5fb50ffbd7a440fe51",
      "translation_text_hash": "c26a1537278729ba6a9e55fa3208959b906fb93b4028ce467d2c1acc1df61887",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "누구든지 귀가 있거든 들을찌어다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c26a1537278729ba6a9e55fa3208959b906fb93b4028ce467d2c1acc1df61887"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:REV:13:10",
      "sequence": 30915,
      "chapter_label": "REV 13",
      "verse_label": "10",
      "locator": {
        "book": "REV",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 10
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "If anyone is to go into captivity, he will go into captivity. If anyone is to be killed with the sword, he must be killed. Here is the endurance and the faith of the saints.",
      "ko": "사로잡는 자는 사로잡힐 것이요 칼로 죽이는 자는 자기도 마땅히 칼에 죽으리니 성도들의 인내와 믿음이 여기 있느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "044deb3e4523387d1a14ed82eddf26400b8fde5b23b62a55879d935e3583f22f",
      "translation_text_hash": "6f0b8565520b099310a59b487c233b91e4de77ef5c3ae47f17bc136ff290fe76",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "사로잡는 자는 사로잡힐 것이요 칼로 죽이는 자는 자기도 마땅히 칼에 죽으리니 성도들의 인내와 믿음이 여기 있느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "6f0b8565520b099310a59b487c233b91e4de77ef5c3ae47f17bc136ff290fe76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:REV:13:11",
      "sequence": 30916,
      "chapter_label": "REV 13",
      "verse_label": "11",
      "locator": {
        "book": "REV",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "I saw another beast coming up out of the earth. He had two horns like a lamb and it spoke like a dragon.",
      "ko": "내가 보매 또 다른 짐승이 땅에서 올라오니 새끼양 같이 두 뿔이 있고 용처럼 말하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "2c08e756e5c0ee78cf3c17165fae2183e8a5c0a27c3b302a4c9cf96672e96208",
      "translation_text_hash": "03e2d74bb6b7788b1b448095e40dcb66fd0fba3dcf2be5f141ac2f1a160d334e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 보매 또 다른 짐승이 땅에서 올라오니 새끼양 같이 두 뿔이 있고 용처럼 말하더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "03e2d74bb6b7788b1b448095e40dcb66fd0fba3dcf2be5f141ac2f1a160d334e"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:REV:13:12",
      "sequence": 30917,
      "chapter_label": "REV 13",
      "verse_label": "12",
      "locator": {
        "book": "REV",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "He exercises all the authority of the first beast in his presence. He makes the earth and those who dwell in it to worship the first beast, whose fatal wound was healed.",
      "ko": "저가 먼저 나온 짐승의 모든 권세를 그 앞에서 행하고 땅과 땅에 거하는 자들로 처음 짐승에게 경배하게 하니 곧 죽게 되었던 상처가 나은 자니라",
      "source_text_hash": "c8bc54ec1e93f520bf9b8cefaf511248c2879b3a9e4268f39948276aeaca198d",
      "translation_text_hash": "aee2fea71dee73da0a13b10df6edbb0f86d24520fbaaef0ac81a2bd385d53337",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저가 먼저 나온 짐승의 모든 권세를 그 앞에서 행하고 땅과 땅에 거하는 자들로 처음 짐승에게 경배하게 하니 곧 죽게 되었던 상처가 나은 자니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "aee2fea71dee73da0a13b10df6edbb0f86d24520fbaaef0ac81a2bd385d53337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:REV:13:13",
      "sequence": 30918,
      "chapter_label": "REV 13",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
        "book": "REV",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 13
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "He performs great signs, even making fire come down out of the sky to the earth in the sight of people.",
      "ko": "큰 이적을 행하되 심지어 사람들 앞에서 불이 하늘로부터 땅에 내려 오게 하고",
      "source_text_hash": "f95535f56cee20a0556b8281a1e63ef4ca8bc953e766fb6f05d4ae1d3a468f34",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d12d1d6955ba4ffae0b6b2cb99e20da6f0515e7cf1bd5fdc3ef848496e171e5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "큰 이적을 행하되 심지어 사람들 앞에서 불이 하늘로부터 땅에 내려 오게 하고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0d12d1d6955ba4ffae0b6b2cb99e20da6f0515e7cf1bd5fdc3ef848496e171e5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:REV:13:14",
      "sequence": 30919,
      "chapter_label": "REV 13",
      "verse_label": "14",
      "locator": {
        "book": "REV",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 14
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "REV",
          "chapter": 13,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "He deceives my own people who dwell on the earth because of the signs he was granted to do in front of the beast, saying to those who dwell on the earth that they should make an image to the beast who had the sword wound and lived.",
